<surname>Delfino</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Singh</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Exposure assessment for atmospheric ultrafine particles (UFPs) and implications in epidemiologic research</article-title><source>Environ Health Perspect</source><year>2005</year><volume>113</volume><fpage>947</fpage><lpage>955</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16079062</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B5"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lundborg</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Johard</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>Lastbom</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Gerde</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Camner</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Human alveolar macrophage phagocytic function is impaired by aggregates of ultrafine carbon particles</article-title><source>Environ Res</source><year>2001</year><volume>86</volume><fpage>244</fpage><lpage>253</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11453675</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1006/enrs.2001.4269</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Brunekreef</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Forsberg</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Epidemiological evidence of effects of coarse airborne particles on health</article-title><source>Eur Resp J</source><year>2005</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>309</fpage><lpage>318</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1183/09031936.05.00001805</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ibald-Mulli</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Wichmann</surname><given-names>HE</given-names></name><name><sur